@startuml
title Save a template - shared domain models
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
hide circle
!$showSaved = 1
!$showDraft = 0
!include shared/template-models.iuml

note left of Template
    Matches the team's Template name and fields.
    Storage assigns templateId on creation.
    A blank name or empty template is rejected.
    Expose collections as read-only snapshots.
end note
note right of ExerciseSetGroup
    Keeps the team's setId field.
    Proposed meaning: group ID unique in a template.
    getGroup(groupId) finds a group by that ID.
    setIndex is a zero-based position within a group.
    Nonempty measurement lists must align by index.
    Units and absent measurements need team agreement.
end note
note right of Exercise
    Shared reference, not owned by one template.
    Full metadata is omitted from this diagram.
end note
@enduml
